 "notes": "Libretto by Lorenzo Da Ponte (1787). Words as sung in the Schirmer vocal score, which the app follows where it differs from the libretto. Leporello's \"d'aqua\" as printed (libretto: d'acqua). Leporello's \"io vo' vedere\" as printed (libretto: veder). The libretto's \"Ciel, che veggio!… Non serve\" is not set in this score. Leporello's \"galant'uom\" as printed. Leporello's \"alla calcagna\" as printed (libretto: alle). Libretto: \"e trascinar\". Not in the libretto: the score gives Elvira \"L'avrà sottratto l'empio suo padrone\", and Masetto's speech is not set. Libretto: \"È desso senza fallo\". Zerlina's \"a lui si aspetta\" as printed (libretto: s'aspetta); the print's accent \"aspettà\" is a misprint and is left off.",
